values.content:
=You are a customer success analyst. Compute a health score (0-100) for this SaaS client and recommend an intervention.

CLIENT DATA:
- Name: {{ $json.name }} at {{ $json.company }}
- Plan: {{ $json.plan }}
- Days since last login: {{ $json.lastLoginDaysAgo }}
- Feature usage: {{ $json.featureUsagePct }}%
- Support tickets this month: {{ $json.supportTicketsThisMonth }}
- Payment status: {{ $json.paymentStatus }}

Scoring guidelines:
- Login frequency: <3 days = healthy, 3-7 = warning, >7 = risk
- Feature usage: >70% = healthy, 40-70% = warning, <40% = risk
- Support tickets: 0-1 = healthy, 2-3 = warning, >3 = risk
- Payment: current = healthy, late = critical risk

Generate exactly this JSON (no markdown fences):
{
  "healthScore": <0-100>,
  "riskLevel": "<healthy|at-risk|critical>",
  "keyRiskFactors": ["<factor 1>", "<factor 2>"],
  "recommendedIntervention": "<specific action for the success team>",
  "confidence": <0.0-1.0>
}
Your ENTIRE response must be that single JSON object.

